postout (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Publish the first stable Postout release.
  * Add personal and shared system SMTP profiles.
  * Support authenticated and unauthenticated SMTP delivery.
  * Support SSL/TLS, STARTTLS, HTML, attachments, CC, and BCC.
  * Add interactive profile configuration and testing.
  * Add Debian packaging, manual page, and complete documentation.
  * Release Postout under the MIT-0 license.

